{"id":"n58156-3-6","stage":1,"title":"바라다 · 望","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58156-3-6-1","ko":"집으로 오는 길을 잃어 버리거든 남쪽만 바라고 오면 돼.","zh":"如果回家的路上迷路了，只要往南方走就行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집으로","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집으로","audio":"/audio/8a97350e9fb8cc1c83d4.mp3"}},{"text":"오는","meaning":"来（回家的路上）","explanation":"오다：来（回家的路上）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오는","audio":"/audio/204311ae50badf5e3adb.mp3"}},{"text":"길을","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길을","audio":"/audio/a41fdccc5780433c53cc.mp3"}},{"text":"잃어","meaning":"迷失","explanation":"잃다：迷失；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"9","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어","audio":"/audio/80e252ade1cdc2c9f9de.mp3"}},{"text":"버리거든","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；거든：提出条件或假设：“如果……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버리거든","audio":"/audio/81a8105992af9e417bce.mp3"}},{"text":"남쪽만","meaning":"南侧，南边，南方","explanation":"남쪽：南侧，南边，南方；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"남쪽","audio":"/audio/aa6ac947e28f5dad655c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63619","senseId":"1","lemma":"남쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남쪽만","audio":"/audio/47a4d4339ef6d5b85061.mp3"}},{"text":"바라고","meaning":"望，朝","explanation":"바라다：望，朝；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"바라다","audio":"/audio/527140f180313dac73f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58156","senseId":"3","lemma":"바라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바라고","audio":"/audio/3255d4306525b2ac6ac8.mp3"}},{"text":"오면","meaning":"经由，途经","explanation":"오다：经由，途经；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"22","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오면","audio":"/audio/db4c994ab297c56bbe00.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来（回家的路上）；经由，途经","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"来（回家的路上）","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"迷失","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"失去方向或迷路。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可